    "cp": 1,
    "summary": "Spend 1 CP in the Fight phase of either turn, right after an enemy unit picks its targets, on a HARLEQUINS or DRUKHARI unit of yours that it targeted with at least one attack. Until the phase ends, whenever a model in that unit that has not yet fought this phase is destroyed, roll a D6, adding 1 if the unit is on the losing side of the wager, and keep it in play on a 4+: it may fight once every attack from the attacker's unit is resolved, and is then removed.",
